          "start_ms": null,
          "text": "Témoignages: LAVERGNE (46) 01.05.2008 T1 LAVERGNE (46) 01.05.2008 Ti2 LAVERGNE (46) 01.05.2008 Ti3",
          "text_sha256": "69c833f505dd40a90e8edc551609ef12c636fa0adb9cb83710abe45e0d0dc170"
        },
        {
          "end_ms": null,
